{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2000_place", "source_sha256": "a637ddaba8236d93e717a7588243d72df14a3d4f555db9af97ad462f9774a1ba", "ja": "野球場", "zh": "棒球场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2001_p", "source_sha256": "89b6ade297048f88232bb57890c511ab56a688fb57a1365742e7a54b76907684", "ja": "いよいよ、マウンドに呼ばれるぞ……。\n美也、心の準備はいいか？", "zh": "终于要被叫上投手丘了……\n美也，做好心理准备了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2002_042miy", "source_sha256": "46921555c86bb449b45da989e5e2ab2b924ddfba38f2cb97c504a466f47855be", "ja": "はい～、バッチリですよ～。{$P$}\nさん、私が投げるところ、見ててくださいね～。", "zh": "是～做好充分准备了喔～{$P$}先生，\n请你好好看我投球喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2003_042miy", "source_sha256": "bc36c2434086877dc6e4469738bf66cc0e9a66899e94fb62cd3e33b7f401532c", "ja": "今日は、えーいって、頑張って投げたら、\n魔球になりそうな気がするんです～。", "zh": "感觉今天只要使劲一投，\n就会投出魔球呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2004_p", "source_sha256": "f8355540dc33a2e55be3d75d744a749d1d2c61e99d277610ede0929d76e7af38", "ja": "魔球って……。\n始球式なんだから、それじゃダメなんじゃないか？", "zh": "你说魔球……\n这是开球典礼，应该不能投这种球吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2005_042miy", "source_sha256": "73746c73b453828cd3b7bb698396cd04a7823b9ab592606022473f9828466606", "ja": "なるほど～、そうでしたか～。\nでは、行ってきますね～。宮尾美也、プレイボ～ル♪", "zh": "原来如此～是这样啊～\n那我就过去了喔～宫尾美也，比赛开始♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_2006_p", "source_sha256": "48851ad76da87116dc4bd10dafb03e830ec5460de25f1b0d12fa08b5f4e70535", "ja": "（魔球とは真逆の、ふわっとした投球だったが……\nおかげでいいムードを作れた。お疲れ、美也！）", "zh": "（结果投出了和魔球完全相反的轻柔一球……\n多亏如此，制造出了不错的气氛，辛苦了，美也！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
